{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:3.45.060","page_type":"section"},"citation":"3.45.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.45.060","content_hash":"b3425915284529ffeadbcf66eca1c719f93e708e9b6547991e7caa48afccfabf","heading":"Certified list of persons notified.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.45.060:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.45.060","text":"The City Clerk shall keep a certified list in the City Clerk’s office of the names and addresses of all the persons who have been mailed the notice provided for in this chapter. The clerk shall certify each such list as follows:\nCERTIFICATE OF MAILING\nI hereby certify that on this ________ day of ________, 20____, that I mailed a copy of notice of public hearing regarding: (street/sewer, etc., improvement project no. ________), by United States mail, postage prepaid, addressed to each of the above-named.\n(Code 1981 § 35-22. Code 1995 § 126-40.)\nCross References: City Clerk, TMC 2.20.010 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"ee7da222-94bb-54a3-b2a8-30886c2cf0fb"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"3.45.060","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.45.060","content_hash":"507aed7215f761c3f35493862489ad88c34fc152d1e2bd97abfaa2627a567db0","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.45.060:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:3.45.060:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/3.45.060","text":"The City Clerk shall keep a certified list in the City Clerk’s office of the names and addresses of all the persons who have been mailed the notice provi